<title>POLAND: NBP DRAINS PLN 788 MLN IN REVREPO, NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP DRAINS PLN 788 MLN IN REVREPO, NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland drained a total of 788 million zlotys from the market through a reverse NBP-bill repurchase auction and an NBP-bill sale, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The maximum rate at the 14-day reverse repo was flat at 19.14 percent and the average yield of the 273-day bills sold at the NBP-bill tender was also flat at 19.95 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
